--Description:
-- 9. Summarise, for each WUSTL imaging assay type, how many *Level‑4 imaging*
--    files list a WUSTL Level‑2 file as their parent.  Join Level‑4 imaging
--    metadata (l4) directly to Level‑2 imaging metadata (l2).
SELECT
